{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876030/extras/620b16919319aac6e679289021ea0817.webp?t=1762712630\" width=800 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monkey Jump is a physics based co-op horror game that you can play with up to 4 friends.<br>The task seems simple: collect the bananas and get out of here.<br>But if it were really that easy... you\u2019d already be gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876030/extras/7acfc49cafda765fb9f45a339168d653.poster.avif?t=1762712630\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876030/extras/7acfc49cafda765fb9f45a339168d653.webm?t=1762712630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876030/extras/7acfc49cafda765fb9f45a339168d653.mp4?t=1762712630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876030/extras/aff9267a3f0c47ada275dbdc0674e569.webp?t=1762712630\" width=800 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every movement matters thanks to the physics based character and map design.<br>The goal is simple: collect all the bananas in the map and escape. Easy enough, right? :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876030/extras/1431f55ef4a52558b60106e89ab21628.poster.avif?t=1762712630\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876030/extras/1431f55ef4a52558b60106e89ab21628.webm?t=1762712630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876030/extras/1431f55ef4a52558b60106e89ab21628.mp4?t=1762712630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876030/extras/13a2b534e7a8f14bea7b9c706465b2de.webp?t=1762712630\" width=800 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can hear your friends\u2019 voices but letting everyone hear yours might be a bad idea.<br>That one friend saying \u201cIt\u2019s safe here!\u201d might go flying 30 meters away the next second.<br>With the proximity based voice system, stay coordinated with your team but never forget that sound can betray you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876030/extras/d0ef2ec604b84122749817a017359a6d.poster.avif?t=1762712630\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876030/extras/d0ef2ec604b84122749817a017359a6d.webm?t=1762712630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876030/extras/d0ef2ec604b84122749817a017359a6d.mp4?t=1762712630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3876030/extras/4b447782074512e3d746472cebcc74da.webp?t=1762712630\" width=800 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create chaos in bright yellow or blend into the darkness.<br>Choose your character\u2019s color, cosmetics, and style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" au